{
  "schema": 1,
  "meta": {
    "id": "coyote",
    "name": "Coyote: Around the Fire",
    "players": {
      "min": 3,
      "max": 4,
      "suggested": 4
    },
    "blurb": "You see every card but your own. Raise the claim about the table's total or call Coyote; whoever is wrong takes a token, and three tokens put you out."
  },
  "statuses": [
    {
      "id": "playing",
      "acts": true,
      "initial": true
    },
    {
      "id": "out",
      "acts": false
    }
  ],
  "attributes": {
    "player": [
      {
        "key": "seat",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number"
      },
      {
        "key": "tokens",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 0
      },
      {
        "key": "alive",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "bool",
        "initial": true
      },
      {
        "key": "card",
        "visible": "others",
        "type": "number"
      }
    ],
    "game": [
      {
        "key": "deck",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "list",
        "initial": [
          -2,
          -1,
          -1,
          0,
          0,
          0,
          1,
          1,
          1,
          2,
          2,
          2,
          3,
          3,
          3,
          4,
          4,
          5,
          5,
          100
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "opener_seat",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "hand_active",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "bool",
        "initial": false
      },
      {
        "key": "round",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "has_declaration",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "bool",
        "initial": false
      },
      {
        "key": "current_declaration",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number"
      },
      {
        "key": "current_declarer",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number"
      },
      {
        "key": "declarations",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "list",
        "initial": []
      },
      {
        "key": "coyote_called",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "bool",
        "initial": false
      },
      {
        "key": "caller",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number"
      },
      {
        "key": "true_total",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number"
      },
      {
        "key": "last_loser",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number"
      },
      {
        "key": "alive_count",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 0
      },
      {
        "key": "revealed",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "list",
        "initial": []
      },
      {
        "key": "token_board",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "list",
        "initial": []
      },
      {
        "key": "pick",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 0
      },
      {
        "key": "order",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "list",
        "initial": []
      },
      {
        "key": "turn_idx",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 0
      },
      {
        "key": "turn_seat",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 0
      },
      {
        "key": "new_hand",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "bool",
        "initial": false
      },
      {
        "key": "just_out",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "bool",
        "initial": false
      },
      {
        "key": "rounds_done",
        "visible": "none",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 0
      },
      {
        "key": "deck_size",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 20
      },
      {
        "key": "count_minus2",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "count_minus1",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 2
      },
      {
        "key": "count_0",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 3
      },
      {
        "key": "count_1",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 3
      },
      {
        "key": "count_2",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 3
      },
      {
        "key": "count_3",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 3
      },
      {
        "key": "count_4",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 2
      },
      {
        "key": "count_5",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 2
      },
      {
        "key": "count_max0",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "max0_code",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 100
      },
      {
        "key": "cards_per_player",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "first_declaration_min",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": -3
      },
      {
        "key": "declaration_max",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 20
      },
      {
        "key": "raise_min_step",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "tokens_to_eliminate",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 3
      },
      {
        "key": "token_per_loss",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      },
      {
        "key": "max_rounds",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 40
      },
      {
        "key": "first_opener_seat",
        "visible": "public",
        "type": "number",
        "initial": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "the table is set",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "tokens",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "alive",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "alive_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "len(players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opener_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "first_opener_seat"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_active",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "rounds_done",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "a new hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "not hand_active"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[-2] * count_minus2 + [-1] * count_minus1 + [0] * count_0 + [1] * count_1 + [2] * count_2 + [3] * count_3 + [4] * count_4 + [5] * count_5 + [max0_code] * count_max0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "card",
            "value": null
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 1 and players[0].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 1 and players[0].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 1 and players[0].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 2 and players[1].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 2 and players[1].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 2 and players[1].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 3 and players[2].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 3,
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 3 and players[2].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 3 and players[2].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4 and players[3].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 4,
            "key": "card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4 and players[3].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4 and players[3].alive"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "has_declaration",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "current_declaration",
            "value": null
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "current_declarer",
            "value": null
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "declarations",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "coyote_called",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "caller",
            "value": null
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_active",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "order",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[x - 10 if x > 10 else x for x in sorted([p.seat + 10 if p.seat < opener_seat else p.seat for p in players if p.alive])]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the cards you can see",
      "when": {
        "calc": "new_hand"
      },
      "to": "acting",
      "mode": "others",
      "fields": [
        "card"
      ],
      "text": "A card you can see (100 means Max\u21920):"
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "deal",
      "label": "the hand opens",
      "when": {
        "calc": "new_hand"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "A new hand begins; seat {opener_seat} opens."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "turns",
      "label": "the round begins",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "turn_idx",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "turn_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "order[0] if len(order) > 0 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "new_hand",
            "value": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "repeat",
      "phase": "turns",
      "label": "the turns",
      "until": {
        "calc": "coyote_called or turn_idx >= len(order)"
      },
      "max": 5,
      "steps": [
        {
          "use": "tell",
          "label": "the declarations so far",
          "to": "all",
          "text": "Seat {turn_seat} to act. Current declaration: {current_declaration}, made by seat {current_declarer}. Declarations this hand [seat, number]: {declarations}."
        },
        {
          "use": "update",
          "label": "coyote is forced",
          "when": {
            "calc": "has_declaration and not coyote_called and current_declaration >= declaration_max"
          },
          "do": [
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "coyote_called",
                "value": true
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "caller",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "turn_seat"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The declaration is at {declaration_max}, so seat {turn_seat} must call Coyote, and does."
        },
        {
          "use": "ask",
          "label": "raise or call coyote",
          "when": {
            "calc": "has_declaration and not coyote_called and current_declaration < declaration_max"
          },
          "to": {
            "where": "you.seat == turn_seat"
          },
          "answer": {
            "type": "number",
            "min": {
              "calc": "current_declaration + raise_min_step"
            },
            "max": {
              "calc": "declaration_max"
            },
            "or": [
              "coyote"
            ]
          },
          "each": {
            "do": [
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "coyote_called",
                  "value": true,
                  "if": {
                    "calc": "$answer == 'coyote'"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "caller",
                  "value": "$seat",
                  "if": {
                    "calc": "$answer == 'coyote'"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "current_declaration",
                  "value": "$answer",
                  "if": {
                    "calc": "$answer != 'coyote'"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "current_declarer",
                  "value": "$seat",
                  "if": {
                    "calc": "$answer != 'coyote'"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "append": {
                  "key": "declarations",
                  "value": {
                    "calc": "[$seat, $answer]"
                  },
                  "if": {
                    "calc": "$answer != 'coyote'"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "broadcast": {
            "to": "all",
            "text": "Seat {seat}: {value}."
          },
          "text": "The current declaration is {current_declaration} by seat {current_declarer}. Either declare a whole number from {current_declaration} + {raise_min_step} up to {declaration_max}, claiming the true total is at least that, or answer coyote to challenge the current declaration."
        },
        {
          "use": "ask",
          "label": "the opening declaration",
          "when": {
            "calc": "not has_declaration and not coyote_called"
          },
          "to": {
            "where": "you.seat == turn_seat"
          },
          "answer": {
            "type": "number",
            "min": {
              "calc": "first_declaration_min"
            },
            "max": {
              "calc": "declaration_max"
            }
          },
          "each": {
            "do": [
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "current_declaration",
                  "value": "$answer"
                }
              },
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "current_declarer",
                  "value": "$seat"
                }
              },
              {
                "set": {
                  "key": "has_declaration",
                  "value": true
                }
              },
              {
                "append": {
                  "key": "declarations",
                  "value": {
                    "calc": "[$seat, $answer]"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "broadcast": {
            "to": "all",
            "text": "Seat {seat} declares {value}."
          },
          "text": "Nobody has declared yet this hand. Declare a whole number from {first_declaration_min} to {declaration_max}: your claim that the true total of all dealt cards is at least that. You may not call Coyote yet."
        },
        {
          "use": "update",
          "label": "the next turn",
          "do": [
            {
              "adjust": {
                "key": "turn_idx",
                "value": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "set": {
                "key": "turn_seat",
                "value": {
                  "calc": "order[turn_idx] if turn_idx < len(order) else 0"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "coyote is resolved",
      "when": {
        "calc": "coyote_called"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[[p.seat, p.card] for p in players if p.alive]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "true_total",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([p.card for p in players if p.alive and p.card != max0_code]) - (max([p.card for p in players if p.alive and p.card != max0_code]) if (max0_code in [p.card for p in players if p.alive]) and max([p.card for p in players if p.alive and p.card != max0_code]) > 0 else 0)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "last_loser",
            "value": {
              "calc": "current_declarer if true_total < current_declaration else caller"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "last_loser"
            },
            "key": "tokens",
            "value": {
              "calc": "token_per_loss"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "just_out",
            "value": {
              "calc": "players[last_loser - 1].tokens >= tokens_to_eliminate"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "last_loser"
            },
            "key": "alive",
            "value": false,
            "if": {
              "calc": "just_out"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "last_loser"
            },
            "to": "out",
            "if": {
              "calc": "just_out"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has {tokens_to_eliminate} tokens and is eliminated."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "alive_count",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "just_out"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "opener_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.alive and p.seat > opener_seat]) if any([p.alive and p.seat > opener_seat for p in players]) else min([p.seat for p in players if p.alive])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hand_active",
            "value": false
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "token_board",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[[p.seat, p.tokens] for p in players]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "the reveal",
      "when": {
        "calc": "coyote_called"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Coyote called by seat {caller}! Cards [seat, card] (100 = Max\u21920): {revealed}. True total {true_total} against the declaration of {current_declaration} by seat {current_declarer}. Seat {last_loser} loses the hand and takes a token. Tokens [seat, tokens]: {token_board}. Seat {opener_seat} will open the next hand."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "resolve",
      "label": "one player left",
      "when": {
        "calc": "alive_count == 1"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end of round",
      "label": "the round ends",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "rounds_done",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end of round",
      "label": "the round limit",
      "when": {
        "calc": "rounds_done >= max_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "alive_count == 1 or rounds_done >= max_rounds"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.alive * 10 - you.tokens",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final [seat, tokens, alive]: {[[p.seat, p.tokens, p.alive] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 40,
    "rounds_max": 41,
    "actions_max": 2000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Seats are numbered clockwise. Everyone starts with 0 tokens and alive. Seat {first_opener_seat} opens the first hand.\n\nThe deck has {deck_size} cards: {count_minus2} of -2, {count_minus1} of -1, {count_0} of 0, {count_1} of 1, {count_2} of 2, {count_3} of 3, {count_4} of 4, {count_5} of 5, and {count_max0} special card Max\u21920 (shown as {max0_code}).\n\nNew hand: at the start of a round with no hand in progress, the deck is restored to all {deck_size} cards and shuffled, and each alive player is dealt {cards_per_player} card face down. You are told the card of every other alive player, never your own. There is no declaration yet, and everyone is told who opens. If a hand is already in progress, it simply continues with the same cards and declarations.\n\nTurn order: in every round each alive player takes exactly one turn, starting with the opener and going clockwise through alive seats. The order is the same every round of a hand, so a hand goes round the table lap after lap. If Coyote is called, the hand ends and the remaining turns of that round are skipped. Before each turn everyone is shown the current declaration, who made it, and every declaration so far this hand.\n\nA turn: if nobody has declared yet this hand, you must declare a whole number from {first_declaration_min} to {declaration_max}; you may not call Coyote. Otherwise you either declare a whole number at least the current declaration + {raise_min_step} and at most {declaration_max}, or call Coyote. If the current declaration is {declaration_max}, you must call Coyote. A declaration makes you the current declarer and your number the current declaration.\n\nTrue total: all cards are revealed. Add all card values, counting Max\u21920 as 0. If Max\u21920 was dealt, the single highest other dealt card counts as 0 instead, provided its value is positive; if several cards tie for highest, only one of them is cancelled. If the highest other card is 0 or less, nothing is cancelled.\n\nResolving Coyote: if the true total is less than the current declaration, the current declarer loses the hand. Otherwise (the true total is equal to or more than the declaration) the caller loses the hand. The loser gains {token_per_loss} token. All cards, the true total and the loser are announced to everyone, and the hand is over.\n\nElimination: a player with {tokens_to_eliminate} tokens is eliminated, receives no more cards and is skipped in turn order.\n\nNext opener: after every hand the opener moves to the next alive player clockwise from the current opener, whoever lost. If the opener was just eliminated, it moves to the next alive player clockwise from their seat.\n\nEnd: the game ends immediately when only one player is alive, and that player wins. If round {max_rounds} ends first, any unfinished hand is discarded without a token, and the alive player with the fewest tokens wins; alive players tied for fewest share the result (a draw). Eliminated players rank below every alive player.\n\nThere is no table talk: declarations and calls are the only communication."
}
